Z||000002||Fiero5||08-31-2001||07:25 PM||||I am getting a set of the red striped ones for my Fiero9. They are awesome!<BR>They are made by BFGoodrich. They are called Scorcher T/A tires. The colored tread stripes come in three colors: Yellow, Red and Blue.<BR>The set I am getting are 205/40VR-16 and they are $110.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Glowing_Fiero9_sig.jpg">          <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||12
